@startuml
actor Staff
actor Learner
participant Admin
participant Core
participant Backend
database Product
Staff -> Admin: Select shared or personal content
Admin -> Core: Verify trusted admin and capabilities
Admin -> Backend: Read scoped unit/course and statistics
Backend -> Product: Read content and original measured evidence
Staff -> Admin: Edit words, reading, practice and guidance
Admin -> Backend: Preview edited lesson (read authorization)
Backend --> Admin: Realtime contract, no provider call
Admin -> Backend: Save with reason, revision and operation UUID
Backend -> Core: Check content.write and authenticator verification
Backend -> Product: Atomic scoped revision, semantic edit, audit and receipt
Staff -> Admin: Explicitly activate course draft
Learner -> Backend: Start course or teacher-station lesson
Backend -> Product: Read active material and retain session contract snapshot
Learner -> Backend: Complete actual lesson
Backend -> Product: Report/evidence and authored homework snapshot
Staff -> Admin: Inspect lesson report, practice attempts and actual prompt
Admin -> Backend: Read scoped lesson
Backend --> Admin: Original measurements and snapshot, or explicit absence
@enduml
